You can find more information about the NHANES survey by clicking on [About NHANES](https://www.cdc.gov/nchs/nhanes/about/):


::: {.cell layout-align="center"}
::: {.cell-output-display}
![](../../assets/images/data2/nhanes2.png){fig-align='center' width=90%}
:::
:::



::: {.cell layout-align="center"}
::: {.cell-output-display}
